config OPLUS_DFR
    bool "Physical Mem Operation Driver (built-in only)"
    default y
    help
      Read-Write physical memory of target process.
      Built-in only (Y): no /proc/modules entry, no taint, no /dev node.
      Communication channel is attached to /proc/version proc_ops ioctl.
      Do NOT set to M — module form defeats the hiding design.
